==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*8 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*4 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*5 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*4 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*7 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is optimized for level 10 units. If you struggle, it may be worth waiting for earlier stages to become available and clearing those first.

It is useful to bring several meatshields such as [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|dual]] [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|erasers]] here, as your units will most likely be capped low at this stage. [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] is recommended for this stage as he can kill off the Owlbrows and chip The Face down, even at a low level. It is also useful to use units with the [[Money Up|Double Bounty]] ability to collect money from the early Jackie Pengs like B.B.Bunnies which drop quite a lot of money. Units that outrange The Face like [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] can be used as backliners in this stage if your money supply is high and consistent.

